<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>VEGA AI Consultancy</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
* {margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
body {font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;background:#0B1120;color:#E5E7EB;line-height:1.6;scroll-behavior:smooth;}
header{padding:20px 8%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);position:sticky;top:0;background:#0B1120;z-index:999;}
.logo{font-size:22px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;}
nav a{margin-left:25px;text-decoration:none;color:#9CA3AF;font-size:14px;transition:0.3s;}nav a:hover{color:#FFFFFF;}
.container{padding:80px 8%;max-width:1200px;margin:auto;}
h1,h2,h3,h4{color:#FFFFFF;}
.subtitle{color:#9CA3AF;margin-bottom:50px;max-width:700px;}
.section{margin-bottom:100px;}
.grid-2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:60px;}
.contact-info h3{margin-bottom:15px;font-size:18px;}
.contact-info p{margin-bottom:20px;color:#9CA3AF;}
form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;}
input,textarea{margin-bottom:20px;padding:14px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:#111827;color:#E5E7EB;font-size:14px;}
textarea{resize:none;height:140px;}
button{padding:14px;border:none;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2563EB,#4F46E5);color:white;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:0.3s;}button:hover{opacity:0.85;}
footer{padding:40px 8%;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);margin-top:80px;color:#6B7280;font-size:13px;text-align:center;}
.card{background:#111827;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;}
.card h4{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:15px;color:#FFFFFF;}
.card p{color:#9CA3AF;margin-bottom:10px;}
@media(max-width:900px){.grid-2{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
<div class="logo">VEGA AI</div>
<nav>
<a href="#home">Home</a>
<a href="#services">Services</a>
<a href="#case-studies">Case Studies</a>
<a href="#about">About</a>
<a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>
</header>

<div class="container" id="home">
<h1>High-Performance Operational Systems with AI Acceleration</h1>
<p class="subtitle">We engineer measurable results by optimizing your operational systems and integrating AI as your performance accelerator. Enterprise-ready solutions tailored for aviation, training, and operational-heavy businesses.</p>
<button onclick="document.getElementById('contact').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">Book Strategy Call</button>
</div>

<div class="container section" id="services">
<h2>Our Services</h2>
<div class="grid-2">
<div class="card">
<h4>Operational System Design</h4>
<p>Process Mapping, KPI Definition, Workflow Optimization, Tool Recommendation</p>
<p>Deliverable: Fully optimized operational blueprint</p>
<p>Expected ROI: 15–25% efficiency gain</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h4>Performance Optimization</h4>
<p>Monitoring Dashboards, Analytics & Reporting, Bottleneck Elimination, Continuous Improvement Loops</p>
<p>Deliverable: Performance dashboard & action plan</p>
<p>Expected ROI: 10–20% operational cost reduction</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h4>AI Acceleration Layer</h4>
<p>RPA, Predictive Analytics, Decision Support, Pilot Implementation</p>
<p>Deliverable: AI-enhanced operational processes</p>
<p>Expected ROI: 5–15% added value in process speed & accuracy</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="container section" id="case-studies">
<h2>Case Studies</h2>
<div class="grid-2">
<div class="card">
<h4>Client: Aviation Operator</h4>
<p>Situation: Manual flight scheduling, high delays</p>
<p>Solution: Operational redesign + AI scheduling pilot</p>
<p>Results: 30% reduction in delays, 20% staff efficiency improvement</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h4>Client: Training Organization</h4>
<p>Situation: Inefficient training assessment workflow</p>
<p>Solution: Workflow optimization, AI-assisted reporting</p>
<p>Results: 25% faster assessments, standardized KPI reporting</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="container section" id="about">
<h2>About VEGA AI</h2>
<p>Founded by an expert with aviation and operational systems background, VEGA AI integrates AI as a strategic tool to accelerate performance. Our methodology focuses on system design, measurable results, and enterprise-grade execution.</p>
</div>

<div class="container section" id="contact">
<h2>Contact Us</h2>
<div class="grid-2">
<div class="contact-info">
<h3>Email</h3>
<p>info@vegaai.agency</p>
<h3>Business Focus</h3>
<p>AI-Enhanced System Design, Performance Optimization, Operational Strategy</p>
<h3>Response Time</h3>
<p>Within 24 business hours</p>
</div>
<form action="https://formspree.io/f/mgebryqw" method="POST">
<input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Full Name" required>
<input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Business Email" required>
<input type="text" name="company" placeholder="Company Name" required>
<input type="text" name="role" placeholder="Role / Position" required>
<input type="text" name="budget" placeholder="Estimated Budget" required>
<input type="text" name="timeline" placeholder="Project Timeline" required>
<textarea name="challenge" placeholder="Describe your main challenge or goal" required></textarea>
<button type="submit">Request Strategy Call</button>
</form>
</div>
</div>

<footer>
© 2026 VEGA AI Consultancy. All rights reserved.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
